  "stem": "A particle is projected vertically upwards from a point A on the ground. It takes time $t_{1}$ to reach a point B, but it still continues to move up. If it takes further $t_{2}$ time to reach the ground from point B. Then height of point B from the ground is?",
  "answer": {
    "text": "$\\frac{1}{2}g(t_{1}t_{2})$"
  },
